            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nAlthough this does sound useful for Python development, adding heavily language-specific functionality is out of scope for 'mini.nvim'. I believe this task is better suited for a separate regular or a \"language pack\" type of plugin. *Or* it seems that reaching to at least 80% of functionality shouldn't be too complicated, so this might be an interesting side project for anyone to add to their config.\n\nAll in all, I am afraid I am going to close this as not planned.",
